@startuml
title Pati — Domain Event ve Workflow Entegrasyonu
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
[Identity] --> [Outbox] : UserRegistered/DeletionRequested
[Pet] --> [Outbox] : PetCreated/HealthRecordAdded
[Provider] --> [Outbox] : ProviderVerified/Suspended
[Booking] --> [Outbox] : ReservationCreated/Accepted/Completed
[Payment] --> [Outbox] : PaymentAuthorized/Refunded/PayoutPaid
[Trust] --> [Outbox] : DisputeOpened/Resolved
[Outbox] --> [NATS JetStream] : at-least-once
[NATS JetStream] --> [Notification Worker]
[NATS JetStream] --> [Analytics Consumer]
[NATS JetStream] --> [AI/3D Worker]
[NATS JetStream] --> [Search Projector]
[NATS JetStream] --> [Temporal Workflow Starter]
[Temporal Workflow Starter] --> [Booking] : command with idempotency
[Temporal Workflow Starter] --> [Payment] : command with idempotency
note bottom
Envelope: eventId, type, schemaVersion, aggregateId,
occurredAt, correlationId, causationId, payload.
Consumer processed_event tablosuyla idempotenttir.
Breaking payload değişikliği yeni major event sürümüdür.
end note
@enduml
